sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Autonomous Agent
    participant Observer as SMAOS Local Observer (passive)
    participant Gateway as Core Banking Gateway

    Observer->>Agent: observes outbound
    Agent->>Gateway: POST /v1/settle (EUR 50,000 to [REDACTED_IBAN])
    Gateway--xAgent: HTTP 403 Forbidden (POLICY_GATE_REJECT)
    Agent->>Agent: logs {"status": "REFUSED"}
    Observer->>Observer: compares wire state vs. claimed state
    Observer->>Observer: emits REFUSED + evidence bundle
